  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<blockquote><p>Cost: 1 Sorcery Point</p></blockquote><p>When you cast a spell that deals a type of damage from the following list, you can spend 1 Sorcery Point to change that damage type to one of the other listed types: Acid, Cold, Fire, Lightning, Poison, Thunder.</p><p><em>Automation (midi-qol entries):</em> offered as you cast a spell (one Metamagic option per spell, Empowered and Seeking combine); its Sorcery Points come from Font of Magic. Careful Spell: the chosen creatures succeed on the save and take no damage from a spell doing half on a success.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
